   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The imperative",
     "texto": [
      "In many instructions, the Norwegian imperative ends in a consonant: **vaske → vask**, **skrelle → skrell** and **skjære → skjær**.",
      "**Vask** can also be a noun («sink»); here it is a verb because it gives an instruction. **Rør** also means «pipe», but in the recipe it means «stir»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
